      "writtenOn": "2023-11-14T10:13:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The fingerprint_info structure describes the sensor parameters like vendor, image resolution, etc, not the FP MCU and comunication (CL line 61: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/4866408/30 ).\nThe DTS has predefined names for things like irq-gpios, so they should/must be used in the device tree, but they do not have the same exact name in the code.\nIn the CL: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/4866410/comment/7f1083e2_9bbfaa09/\nyou can see in first ans second line above your comment that Patryk is assigning the value of `irq-gpios` (converted to C/C++ name as `irq_gpios`) to the `interrupt` and `reset-gpios` to `reset_pin`.",
      "parentUuid": "d34f4545_9b0df864",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 37,
        "startChar": 6,
        "endLine": 37,
        "endChar": 11
      },
      "revId": "7f7ee0bf33ad9a8bfe748f8fedce1b2758314ff0",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
